"Cover Image.png", "id": "1345670102989077", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974671_1345670106322410_2365697592768080109_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NnbDaWY2dgkQ7kNvwHzMiO_&_nc_oc=Adqwwh3QLyhKeIs0z3f_I3erv6pgLsts0dm60YtV7ahj5gh9yo69zRCfDHPo2rvQKhE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af25WiKK8r_iZYNDI5JPUd4kuHdQ1yL9AwBdM6itC2SUVw&oe=69F36CF6"}, "display_name": "Dreaming: Amy Beach MR", "keywords": ["Dreaming", "Amy", "Beach", "Haunted", "Planet"], "long_description": "\u201cDreaming: Amy Beach MR\u201d is the first in a series of Mixed Reality experiences that explore philosophical concepts related to dreams and dreaming in music, literature and science. It is a short, meditative experience based on a composition by American female composer-synesthete Amy Beach (1867-1944). \u201cYou Speak to Me from the Depth of a Dream\u201d was the quote from Victor Hugo that Amy Beach chose as the epigraph for her composition \u201cDreaming\u201d from Four Sketches Op. 15 N3 (1892).", "short_description": "\u201cDreaming: Amy Beach MR\u201d is the first in a series of Mixed Reality experiences that explore philosophical concepts related to dreams and dreaming in music, literature and science. It is a short, meditative experience based on a composition by American female composer-synesthete Amy Beach (1867-1944). \u201cYou Speak to Me from the Depth of a Dream\u201d was the quote from Victor Hugo that Amy Beach chose as the epigraph for her composition \u201cDreaming\u201d from Four Sketches Op. 15 N3 (1892)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hauntedplanet.com/privacy/amy-beach", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Haunted Planet", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://hauntedplanet.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "AP